      "opening": "The Monarch's ramp stood open, wide enough for two vehicles. A truck loaded with steel plates occupied the middle. Dense machinery had been chained beside it, fastened directly to the ramp's structure. Its outer lip rested on the pier. At the shipward end, two immense hinges and hydraulic arms held it to the bow."
