      "sha256": "4ec44e3db0f0f4c6470f3d0c34f0fc74c3a79e6ccadb34209992478ff29d9b46",
      "opening": "Outside Bách's hall, guests had filled the pavement before the doors opened. Polished cars stood among flower vans. A man Minh had once helped recover a stolen truck arrived carrying a roasted pig. Marisol brought an envelope and said she had deducted nothing, making Leon visibly suspicious. Veronica arrived with her husband and reported that the arcade had never earned as much as during the week people came to see the damaged pool table."
